{"title":"Shell Stone","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Mossback, Mossback Ancient</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"mossback-ancient\" title=\"Mossback Ancient - dropped it in 3 of 5 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/cffbdf7d80a1f1840dde.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mossback Ancient</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"mossback\" title=\"Mossback - dropped it in 6 of 11 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/45163107ab22a39c798d.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mossback</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"shell-stone\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"Shell Stone\"></div><h3>Shell Stone</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/19/2026, 7:46:30 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}